# Vercel needs a committed lockfile for reproducible installs. While this
# project is staged inside the tg-widgets working tree, that repo's root
# .gitignore excludes every package-lock.json, so it is re-included here
# explicitly. Harmless once this repo stands alone.
!package-lock.json
